abstract: >-
  C2GRAPH (Convert to Graph Engineering) is a repository-level governance
  package for long-running AI coding agents. It moves selected execution
  state out of transient conversation history and into explicit repository
  contracts so that objectives, evidence, semantic scope, exact write
  authority, rollback and freshness, continuity, provenance, model/runtime
  adaptation, and verification can be inspected independently. Version 1.2.0
  adds Bounded Emergency Authorization v2, Adaptive Context Representation
  Planning, C2GRAPH-native Cognitive Emergency Authorization, Progress
  Liveness & Bounded Self-Audit, stricter runtime-state validation, handoff
  telemetry hardening, and authority non-interference while preserving the
  canonical mutation contract.

